WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:04.610
Bonicle Bill the Sail, Bill the Sail

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.980
Ahoy, ahoy, ahoy, a ship, ahoy

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:16.730
Bill the Sail, I never can get out

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:18.820
Bonicle Bill the Sail

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:21.460
I drink my whiskey when I can

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.200
My whiskey from an old to death

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.140
Oh, whiskey is the life of man

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.200
Said Bonicle the Sail

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:41.940
Yo ho, yo ho ho!

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:50.280
BING AT THE SAME OF YOUR DEADS THEMORE!

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:01.540
I'm free.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.160
A sail of life, the life.

00:01:23.110 --> 00:01:23.350
Thank you.

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:13.540
Oh yeah, there's someone.

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:04.500
I fight and swear and drink and smoke

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.700
But I can't swim a bloomin' stroke

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.440
My barnacle will be lost and

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:08.820
Tough

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:26.500
Enough

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:36.440
I drink my whiskey when I can, whiskey from an old tin can, for whiskey is the life of man.

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:12.870
I'll pick your wine and eat your pie

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:15.050
I'll kiss your cheeks and whack your eyes

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:41.960
Bonicle Bill the sailor.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:43.980
Joey Ho and a bottle of rum.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:44.840
Ha ha ha!

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:45.890
Wah ha ha!

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.920
Oh, hey, big a jink and a rollin'.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:55.360
Hell, Bonicle Bill the sailor.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:43.620
Report!

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.130
All right, it's going to be a lot to you.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.190
But I bought my barnacles in the cell.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:53.720
With my false heart and flattering tongue, I court them all, both old and young.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.820
I court them all, but marries none.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.360
I'm learning to build the same.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:02.260
Ciao.

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:23.150
Tonight I'm sailing from this shore, I'm article Bill the sailor.

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:25.470
For me to come.

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:26.530
All right.

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:31.770
Goodbye!
